hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15668","Wahb ibn Jarir narrated to us, Shubah narrated to us, from Abi Iyas, from his father, that he came to the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, and he supplicated for him and wiped his head."
"15669","Wahb narrated to us, Shubah narrated to us, from Muawiyah ibn Qurrah, from his father, from the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, he said: Concerning fasting three days of the month: the fast of a lifetime and its breaking."
